<title>USA: Comerica sets 12 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Comerica sets 12 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comerica Inc said its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 12 million shares, or 11.4 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased in the open market or through negotiated transactions and used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The program is in addition to an existing program under which 4.2 million shares may be repurchased.</p>
<p>Comerica had 105.6 million shares of common outstanding as of June 30.</p>
</text>
